# The fuzzing tools, stated once. `just fuzz-setup` installs them, `just fuzz`
# refuses any other installation, the nightly fuzz soak runs both recipes, and
# `just doctor` reports cargo-afl against CARGO_AFL_VERSION.
#
# The nightly toolchain is in rust-toolchain.toml in this directory. The LLVM
# that the AFL++ plugins build against is not stated here: it must be the LLVM
# of that nightly (`rustc -vV`), and `just fuzz-setup` derives its major
# version from rustc.
#
# AFL++ is the release that cargo-afl bundles, so it follows from
# CARGO_AFL_VERSION. That release is Apache-2.0. cargo-afl builds it from
# source into the user's data directory; no shipping crate depends on it.
CARGO_AFL_VERSION=0.18.2
